{"actor": "agent:sonnet", "data": {"commit": "27dbee34eee45dac6d9f29d7308101683468ad88", "cost_usd": 0.0451499, "denials": [], "features": ["F1", "F2"], "model": "sonnet", "result": "planned", "risks": ["Using abs(new) > limit alone (without the abs(new) > abs(current) guard) blocks reducing orders when already over the limit, which violates invariant 2 and AGENTS.md rule 5.", "Checking the limit against order.qty instead of the resulting net position (current + signed_qty) gives wrong results for shorts and for BUY vs SELL; sign errors on SELL are easy to make.", "Flip orders (long to short through zero) are neither plain reductions nor plain increases. Judge them by the final abs(new) vs abs(current), not by side alone.", "Existing margin check runs on all orders, including reducing ones, so a reducing order can still be rejected for INSUFFICIENT_MARGIN. This is a pre-existing behavior that conflicts with AGENTS.md rule 5. The invariants use RICH margin so they will not catch it. Do not silently change it. Flag it in the notes for a human.", "Check ordering: if the limit check runs before the margin check, an order failing both reports POSITION_LIMIT instead of INSUFFICIENT_MARGIN. Keep it with the risk checks and keep exactly one Reason per rejection.", "A missing key must mean no limit. Do not use `.get(symbol, 0)` for the limit, because that would reject everything. Treat missing positions as 0 but missing limits as None.", "Never convert to float or build Decimals from floats. Use Decimal(0), not 0.0. Mixing int literals is fine, float is not.", "Adding the Account field in the wrong position, or without default_factory, breaks existing Account(...) callers and the shared mutable default.", "Do not mutate account.positions or position_limits, for example by using setdefault. validate_order must stay pure.", "Invariant files, factory.toml, CODEOWNERS and .github/ are human-owned. If an invariant looks wrong, stop and note it rather than editing."], "session_id": "160ded75-d8bd-48a5-af0c-eddcd02db30e", "session_log": ".factory/WO-001/sessions/plan.json", "started_seq": 7, "tokens": {"in": 21168, "out": 2008}, "tool_calls": {"Glob": 1, "Read": 3, "StructuredOutput": 1}}, "event": "plan.created", "hash": "0b1b219d620f0b9f02c701efb17c66dddc4ba10b3a6dd442bb7b650c6d05ec72", "prev_hash": "275a5160d8935c8a235321e7db45b19908ae04a2405b33eeb206b4521e44a6c1", "seq": 8, "ts": "2026-11-24T06:01:02+00:00", "work_order": "WO-001"}
